<title>USA: Maine State Housing Authority $25 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Maine State Housing Authority $25 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said Thursday it repriced $25 million of Maine State Housing Authority mortgage purchase 1996 Series C AMT revenue bonds, cutting the yield in 2028 to 6.15 percent from 6.20 percent.</p>
<p>MAINE STATE HOUSING AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000*</p>
<p>MORTGAGE PURCHASE BONDS, 1996 SERIES C</p>
<p>(AMT)</p>
<p>WE HAVE RECEIVED THE VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>PLEASE NOTE REPRICING FOR THE 2028 MATURITY ONLY.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: Aa		    S&amp;P: AA-</p>
<p>		 EXPECTED		   CONFIRMED</p>
<p> DATED: 11/15/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 05/15/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 11/15</p>
<p>ALL BONDS ARE PRICED AT PAR.</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON</p>
<p>11/15/1999		  340M    4.35  %</p>
<p>11/15/2000		  355M    4.55  %</p>
<p>11/15/2001		  370M    4.75  %</p>
<p>11/15/2002		  390M    4.90  %</p>
<p>11/15/2003		  405M    5.00  %</p>
<p>11/15/2004		  425M    5.10  %</p>
<p>11/15/2005		  450M    5.20  %</p>
<p>11/15/2006		  475M    5.30  %</p>
<p>11/15/2007		  495M    5.40  %</p>
<p>11/15/2008		  525M    5.50  %</p>
<p>11/15/2016		5,500M    6.10  %</p>
<p>11/15/2028	     15,170M    6.15  %</p>
<p>11/15/2037		  100M    6.25  %</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 11/15/2006 at 102.00, DTP 11/15/2008.</p>
<p>The award is expected Friday, November 22, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 10, 1996.</p>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co. Incorporated</p>
